    "title": "Lady Greyhounds go undefeated at Wildcat Classic to capture first place - NewsBreak",
    "text": "18 hours ago The Boerne High volleyball team didn’t drop a set or a game at last weekend’s inaugural Wildcat Classic in Elgin. BHS won all six matches played and defeated Greenwood for the championship in straight sets. The Lady Greyhounds swept all six opponents last weekend and bumped its record to 18-3 overall. Read full article\n1",
